  "title": "求不等式组公共解集及指定整数解",
  "stem": "解不等式组\\(\\begin{cases} 2x+4\\ge 0 \\\\ 3\\left ( { x-1 } \\right ) < 2x \\end{cases}\\)",
  "choices": [],
